<title>USA: Anixter International Inc Q1 net rises.</title>
<headline>Anixter International Inc Q1 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr primary		$0.23		    $0.20</p>
<p> Net			   11.1		     10.3</p>
<p> Revs			 658.7		    567.4</p>
<p> Avg shrs primary	  47.8		     52.2</p>
<p>(All data above millions except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 1997 includes nonrecurring, pre-tax gain of $2.1 million related to the Antec Corp/TSX Corp merger. Anixter said it holds a 19 percent interest in the merged companies and has ceased recording equity earnings.</p>
</text>
